OL,3,GNEWSAWhat big issues are on the agenda
OL,4,Aas Stormont returns after summer?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's not even the start of a new
OL,7,FStormont term and already there have
OL,8,Fbeen leaks.
OL,10,FAlbeit it wasn't some big scoop but a
OL,11,Frather damp surprise for the Social
OL,12,FDemocratic and Labour Party (SDLP) MLA
OL,13,FColin McGrath, who took to social media
OL,14,Fsaying a water leak over summer had
OL,15,Fleft his assembly office looking worse
OL,16,Ffor wear.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
