OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWhat big issues are on the agenda
OL,4,Aas Stormont returns after summer?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEven the most casual observers of
OL,7,Fpolitics here could guess, however,
OL,8,Fthat Stormont's leaky roof problems are
OL,9,Foutweighed by the ever-slow drip of
OL,10,Fpolitical activity inside the building
OL,11,F- a place the assembly's freshest face
OL,12,Fwill witness for himself from this
OL,13,Fweek.
OL,15,FOn Tuesday, Paul Boggs was named Sinn
OL,16,FFein's new West Tyrone MLA after
OL,17,FMaoliosa McHugh - who'd already said he
OL,18,Fwouldn't run in the next election -
OL,19,Fdecided to call it quits.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
